{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Create a premium "How it works" section with exactly 4 cards, using the same layout and styling as the attached example.
    
    ## Section heading
    
    Add a centered heading:
    
    "How it works"
    
    The heading must be editable from the Shopify theme editor.
    
    ---
    
    ## Desktop layout
    
    * Display exactly 4 cards.
    * Show all 4 cards at once.
    * Center the cards inside the section.
    * Equal spacing between cards.
    * Rounded corners.
    * Light gray background.
    * Premium Apple-inspired design.
    
    ---
    
    ## Mobile layout
    
    * Show one large card with part of the next card visible.
    * Smooth horizontal swiping.
    * Exactly 4 pagination dots.
    * One dot per card.
    * Dots must update correctly.
    * Users must still be able to scroll the page vertically when touching the slider.
    
    ---
    
    ## Card structure
    
    Each card contains:
    
    ### Step badge
    
    Small label at the top:
    
    STEP 1
    STEP 2
    STEP 3
    STEP 4
    
    The badge should be small, subtle and uppercase.
    
    ---
    
    ### Title
    
    Card 1
    **Choose Your Gift**
    
    Card 2
    **Upload Memories**
    
    Card 3
    **Set The Opening Date**
    
    Card 4
    **Recipient Unlocks It**
    
    ---
    
    ### Description
    
    Card 1
    
    Select the perfect time capsule and create a meaningful gift for someone special.
    
    Card 2
    
    Add photos, videos, voice messages and heartfelt memories inside your capsule.
    
    Card 3
    
    Choose the exact date and time when the memories will become accessible.
    
    Card 4
    
    The recipient simply taps their phone and unlocks the capsule when the countdown ends.
    
    ---
    
    ### Image area
    
    * Large image placed near the bottom.
    * Full card width.
    * Square image area.
    * aspect-ratio: 1 / 1.
    * object-fit: cover.
    * Rounded corners.
    * Image should never appear as a small thumbnail.
    
    ---
    
    ## Theme editor settings
    
    Allow editing:
    
    * Section title
    * Background color
    * Card background color
    * Border color
    * Badge color
    * Title color
    * Description color
    * Border radius
    * Card spacing
    * Desktop image
    * Mobile image
    
    Desktop and mobile images should be separate, with desktop image used as fallback if no mobile image is provided.
    
    Keep the overall appearance identical to the premium Apple-style card layout shown in the example.
    , The current mobile behavior is incorrect.
    
    I cannot swipe left and right with my finger.
    
    Please fix the touch interaction without changing the visual design.
    
    Requirements:
    
    * Users must be able to drag the carousel left and right with one finger.
    * Swiping left or right should smoothly move between cards.
    * Users must also be able to scroll the page vertically when their finger starts on a card or image.
    * The carousel must never lock or trap the finger.
    * Horizontal swiping and vertical page scrolling must both work naturally.
    
    Do not use custom drag logic.
    
    Do not call:
    
    ```javascript
    preventDefault()
    stopPropagation()
    ```
    
    on touch events.
    
    Do not disable pointer events.
    
    Do not use any code that hijacks gestures.
    
    Use native scrolling:
    
    ```css
    .carousel-track {
      overflow-x: auto;
      overflow-y: visible;
      display: flex;
      scroll-snap-type: x mandatory;
      -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch;
      overscroll-behavior-x: contain;
    }
    
    .carousel-card {
      flex: 0 0 auto;
      scroll-snap-align: start;
    }
    ```
    
    If JavaScript is used, use passive touch listeners:
    
    ```javascript
    { passive: true }
    ```
    
    Never use:
    
    ```javascript
    touchmove => preventDefault()
    pointermove => preventDefault()
    ```
    
    The final experience should behave like Apple's product sliders:
    
    * Swipe left/right = move cards
    * Swipe up/down = scroll page
    * No locking
    * No stuck gestures
    * No blocked scrolling
    
    Keep the current layout, card sizes, typography, colors and images exactly as they are.
    , Add a circular arrow button on the right side of the mobile carousel so users can also navigate by tapping.
    
    Keep the current design exactly the same and only add this control.
    
    Requirements:
    
    * Add one circular arrow button on the right side of the carousel.
    * The button should float over the carousel area, vertically centered.
    * Use a clean minimal arrow icon pointing right.
    * Button style should feel premium and subtle.
    * The button should have a circular background.
    * On tap/click, it should move the carousel to the next card.
    * When it reaches the last card, tapping again should return to the first card.
    * The arrow button must work on mobile and desktop.
    * Do not remove swipe behavior.
    * Do not change the card layout, spacing, images, colors, or typography.
    * Keep the 4 pagination dots working as they are.
    
    This button is a fallback navigation option in case finger swiping does not work.
    
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}

{% style %}
  .ai-how-it-works-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    padding: 60px 20px;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.section_background_color }};
  }

  .ai-how-it-works-container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    max-width: 1400px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .ai-how-it-works-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 42px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: -1px;
    margin: 0 0 50px;
    color: {{ block.settings.heading_color }};
  }

  .ai-how-it-works-carousel-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: relative;
  }

  .ai-how-it-works-cards-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
    gap: {{ block.settings.card_spacing }}px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .ai-how-it-works-card-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    background-color: {{ block.settings.card_background_color }};
    border: 1px solid {{ block.settings.card_border_color }};
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.border_radius }}px;
    padding: 30px 24px 24px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 16px;
    transition: transform 0.3s ease, box-shadow 0.3s ease;
  }

  .ai-how-it-works-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover {
    transform: translateY(-4px);
    box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
  }

  .ai-how-it-works-badge-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.5px;
    color: {{ block.settings.badge_color }};
    opacity: 0.7;
  }

  .ai-how-it-works-card-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: 22px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: -0.8px;
    margin: 0;
    color: {{ block.settings.title_color }};
    line-height: 1.3;
  }

  .ai-how-it-works-card-description-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: {{ block.settings.description_color }};
    margin: 0;
    flex-grow: 1;
  }

  .ai-how-it-works-card-image-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 100%;
    aspect-ratio: 1 / 1;
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.border_radius }}px;
    overflow: hidden;
    margin-top: auto;
  }

  .ai-how-it-works-card-image-{{ ai_gen_id }} img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    display: block;
  }

  .ai-how-it-works-card-image-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    background-color: #f4f4f4;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .ai-how-it-works-card-image-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }} svg {
    width: 60%;
    height: 60%;
    opacity: 0.3;
  }

  .ai-how-it-works-nav-button-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: none;
  }

  .ai-how-it-works-pagination-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: none;
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 989px) {
    .ai-how-it-works-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: 32px;
      margin-bottom: 40px;
    }

    .ai-how-it-works-cards-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
      gap: 20px;
    }
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 749px) {
    .ai-how-it-works-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      padding: 40px 0;
    }

    .ai-how-it-works-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: 28px;
      margin-bottom: 30px;
      padding: 0 20px;
    }

    .ai-how-it-works-cards-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      display: flex;
      grid-template-columns: none;
      gap: 16px;
      overflow-x: auto;
      overflow-y: visible;
      scroll-snap-type: x mandatory;
      -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch;
      scrollbar-width: none;
      padding: 0 20px;
      overscroll-behavior-x: contain;
    }

    .ai-how-it-works-cards-{{ ai_gen_id }}::-webkit-scrollbar {
      display: none;
    }

    .ai-how-it-works-card-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      flex: 0 0 85%;
      scroll-snap-align: start;
      min-width: 85%;
    }

    .ai-how-it-works-nav-button-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      position: absolute;
      right: 8px;
      top: 50%;
      transform: translateY(-50%);
      width: 44px;
      height: 44px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.95);
      border: 1px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
      box-shadow: 0 2px 12px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.12);
      cursor: pointer;
      z-index: 10;
      transition: all 0.2s ease;
      padding: 0;
    }

    .ai-how-it-works-nav-button-{{ ai_gen_id }}:active {
      transform: translateY(-50%) scale(0.95);
      box-shadow: 0 1px 6px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.15);
    }

    .ai-how-it-works-nav-button-{{ ai_gen_id }} svg {
      width: 20px;
      height: 20px;
      stroke: {{ block.settings.title_color }};
      stroke-width: 2;
      fill: none;
    }

    .ai-how-it-works-pagination-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 8px;
      margin-top: 24px;
      padding: 0 20px;
    }

    .ai-how-it-works-dot-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      width: 8px;
      height: 8px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background-color: {{ block.settings.badge_color }};
      opacity: 0.3;
      transition: opacity 0.3s ease, transform 0.3s ease;
    }

    .ai-how-it-works-dot-{{ ai_gen_id }}.active {
      opacity: 1;
      transform: scale(1.2);
    }
  }
{% endstyle %}

<how-it-works-{{ ai_gen_id }} class="ai-how-it-works-{{ ai_gen_id }}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
  <div class="ai-how-it-works-container-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
    {% if block.settings.section_heading != blank %}
      <h2 class="ai-how-it-works-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.section_heading }}</h2>
    {% endif %}

    <div class="ai-how-it-works-carousel-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
      <div class="ai-how-it-works-cards-{{ ai_gen_id }}" data-cards-container>
        {% for i in (1..4) %}
          {% liquid
            assign step_key = 'step_' | append: i | append: '_badge'
            assign title_key = 'step_' | append: i | append: '_title'
            assign description_key = 'step_' | append: i | append: '_description'
            assign desktop_image_key = 'step_' | append: i | append: '_desktop_image'
            assign mobile_image_key = 'step_' | append: i | append: '_mobile_image'

            assign step_badge = block.settings[step_key]
            assign step_title = block.settings[title_key]
            assign step_description = block.settings[description_key]
            assign desktop_image = block.settings[desktop_image_key]
            assign mobile_image = block.settings[mobile_image_key]

            if mobile_image != blank
              assign display_image = mobile_image
            else
              assign display_image = desktop_image
            endif
          %}

          <div class="ai-how-it-works-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}" data-card-index="{{ i }}">
            {% if step_badge != blank %}
              <div class="ai-how-it-works-badge-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ step_badge }}</div>
            {% endif %}

            {% if step_title != blank %}
              <h3 class="ai-how-it-works-card-title-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ step_title }}</h3>
            {% endif %}

            {% if step_description != blank %}
              <p class="ai-how-it-works-card-description-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ step_description }}</p>
            {% endif %}

            <div class="ai-how-it-works-card-image-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              {% if display_image != blank %}
                <img
                  src="{{ display_image | image_url: width: 800 }}"
                  alt="{{ step_title | escape }}"
                  loading="lazy"
                  width="800"
                  height="800"
                >
              {% else %}
                <div class="ai-how-it-works-card-image-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                  {{ 'image' | placeholder_svg_tag }}
                </div>
              {% endif %}
            </div>
          </div>
        {% endfor %}
      </div>

      <button 
        class="ai-how-it-works-nav-button-{{ ai_gen_id }}" 
        data-nav-button
        aria-label="Next card"
      >
        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
          <polyline points="9 18 15 12 9 6"></polyline>
        </svg>
      </button>
    </div>

    <div class="ai-how-it-works-pagination-{{ ai_gen_id }}" data-pagination>
      {% for i in (1..4) %}
        <div class="ai-how-it-works-dot-{{ ai_gen_id }}" data-dot="{{ i }}"></div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</how-it-works-{{ ai_gen_id }}>

<script>
  (function() {
    class HowItWorks{{ ai_gen_id }} extends HTMLElement {
      constructor() {
        super();
        this.cardsContainer = null;
        this.navButton = null;
        this.cards = [];
        this.dots = [];
        this.currentIndex = 0;
        this.isMobile = false;
      }

      connectedCallback() {
        this.cardsContainer = this.querySelector('[data-cards-container]');
        this.navButton = this.querySelector('[data-nav-button]');
        this.cards = Array.from(this.querySelectorAll('[data-card-index]'));
        this.dots = Array.from(this.querySelectorAll('[data-dot]'));
        
        this.checkMobile();
        this.setupScrollListener();
        this.setupNavButton();
        this.updateActiveDot();
        
        window.addEventListener('resize', () => this.checkMobile());
      }

      checkMobile() {
        const wasMobile = this.isMobile;
        this.isMobile = window.innerWidth <= 749;
        
        if (wasMobile !== this.isMobile) {
          this.updateActiveDot();
        }
      }

      setupScrollListener() {
        if (!this.cardsContainer) return;

        let scrollTimeout;
        this.cardsContainer.addEventListener('scroll', () => {
          clearTimeout(scrollTimeout);
          scrollTimeout = setTimeout(() => {
            this.updateActiveDot();
          }, 100);
        }, { passive: true });
      }

      setupNavButton() {
        if (!this.navButton) return;

        this.navButton.addEventListener('click', () => {
          this.scrollToNext();
        });
      }

      scrollToNext() {
        if (!this.cardsContainer || !this.isMobile) return;

        const nextIndex = (this.currentIndex + 1) % 4;
        const card = this.cards[nextIndex];
        
        if (card) {
          card.scrollIntoView({
            behavior: 'smooth',
            block: 'nearest',
            inline: 'start'
          });
        }
      }

      updateActiveDot() {
        if (!this.isMobile || !this.cardsContainer) {
          this.dots.forEach((dot, index) => {
            if (index === 0) {
              dot.classList.add('active');
            } else {
              dot.classList.remove('active');
            }
          });
          return;
        }

        const scrollLeft = this.cardsContainer.scrollLeft;
        const cardWidth = this.cards[0]?.offsetWidth || 0;
        const gap = 16;
        const scrollPosition = scrollLeft + (cardWidth / 2);
        const index = Math.floor(scrollPosition / (cardWidth + gap));
        
        this.currentIndex = Math.min(Math.max(index, 0), 3);

        this.dots.forEach((dot, i) => {
          if (i === this.currentIndex) {
            dot.classList.add('active');
          } else {
            dot.classList.remove('active');
          }
        });
      }
    }

    customElements.define('how-it-works-{{ ai_gen_id }}', HowItWorks{{ ai_gen_id }});
  })();
</script>

